{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>每次出門採購都要重新建立同一份清單，既花時間又容易遺漏。Repeat Grocery List 正是針對這件重複工作而設，讓你一次輸入常用物品，購物時逐項勾選，完成後重置清單，下次直接沿用；程式沒有食譜規劃、餐單日曆或家庭動態等複雜設計，設定簡單直接。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-166.webp\">\n<h2>一次輸入常用物品重複使用</h2>\n<p>打開 Repeat Grocery List，先把牛奶、雞蛋、麵包、飲用水等常用物品加入同一份清單，之後每次購物都沿用這份清單。在店內逐項勾選，完成後重置清單，所有項目即回復待購狀態，下次出門可直接使用。整個流程只圍繞一份熟悉的清單，沒有多餘設定畫面或額外管理步驟。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-185-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-186-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-187-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-188-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-189-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Repeat Grocery List</li>\n<li>應用類別：Shopping</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.964467+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":346,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T17:20:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:17:35.356433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:52.511988+00:00","content_hash":"d9ba90335ac7ed882c27a6313a8ff8db15e38cde449ed54d5a035d9999f18f04","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}